# What the English translation takes from ROenglishRE's Compatibility layers.
#
# A layer is dated by the client program it was made for: ROenglishRE's
# ClientGenerator stacks every layer up to the date of the player's Ragexe. Here
# the program reading the files is roBrowser at the chosen packet version, so
# link-assets stacks every layer dated on or before that version, oldest first,
# using a layer's Renewal/ or Pre-Renewal/ folder when it has one -- the same
# rule ClientGenerator follows.
#
# Not everything in a layer is taken. Tables such as EnchantList,
# ItemReformSystem and the Laphine boxes are older English snapshots of content
# a player's own GRF carries newer; swapping them in would trade entries for
# English. What is taken is what only replaces Korean with English:
#
#   take <prefix>   a path under a layer, or the start of one
#   skip <prefix>   an exception to the takes
#
# package.sh ships what matches; link-assets copies it into place. Single
# files that ignore the date are in TRANSLATION_EXTRAS, which is applied after.

# Images with their words drawn in: buttons and window art.
take	data/texture/

# Reputation group and faction names (read from 20220330).
take	data/contentdata/repute/

# Emotion names (read from 20230302).
take	data/simplemsg/msg_emotion.csv

